### Test Suites

#### [NEW] [CreateUrlEndpointTests.cs](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/tests/UrlShortener.FunctionalTests/Endpoints/CreateUrlEndpointTests.cs)
Tests `POST /api/v1/urls`:
- **Auto-generated code:** Returns `201 Created`, valid `shortCode`, `shortUrl`, matching `originalUrl`.
- **Custom alias:** Returns `201 Created` with custom alias.
- **Custom alias conflict:** Creating the same alias twice returns `409 Conflict`.
- **Validation:** Empty string URL returns `400 Bad Request`.
- **Validation:** Malformed / relative URL (e.g., `"not-a-url"`) returns `400 Bad Request`.
- **Validation:** Unsupported scheme (e.g., `"ftp://files.example.com"`) returns `400 Bad Request`.

#### [NEW] [RedirectEndpointTests.cs](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/tests/UrlShortener.FunctionalTests/Endpoints/RedirectEndpointTests.cs)
Tests `GET /{shortCode}`:
- **Valid redirect:** Returns `302 Found` with exact `Location` header; does not follow redirect.
- **Missing short code:** Returns `404 Not Found`.
- **Telemetry headers:** Verifies request with `User-Agent` and `Referer` succeeds with 302 and low latency.

#### [NEW] [AnalyticsEndpointTests.cs](file:///c:/Repos/URL-Shortener/tests/UrlShortener.FunctionalTests/Endpoints/AnalyticsEndpointTests.cs)
Tests `GET /api/v1/urls/{shortCode}/analytics`:
- **Zero clicks:** Newly created URL returns `200 OK` with `totalClicks = 0`, empty `topReferers`, empty `recentClicks`.
- **Missing short code:** Returns `404 Not Found`.
- **End-to-End Pipeline Roundtrip:**
  1. POST URL to create short code.
  2. GET redirect with `User-Agent = "IntegrationTestRunner/2.0"` and `Referer = "https://github.com/martinnv6/URL-Shortener"`.
  3. Poll `WaitForAnalyticsAsync` until `totalClicks == 1`.
  4. Assert `totalClicks == 1`.
  5. Assert `topReferers` contains `"https://github.com/martinnv6/URL-Shortener"` with count 1.
  6. Assert `recentClicks[0]` has expected `UserAgent`, `Referer`, and UTC timestamp within the last minute.
- **Multiple Clicks & Aggregation:**
  - Simulates 3 additional clicks across multiple distinct referrers.
  - Awaits worker processing (`totalClicks == 4`).
  - Verifies referrer ranking aggregation (descending count) and chronological order of recent clicks.

